@startuml UC005_Comment_Sequence
!theme plain
title UC005 — Read and submit comments
actor Viewer
participant "frontend/feed/CommentSection.jsx" as Comments
participant "frontend/feed/feedApi.js; shared session transport)" as Client
participant "src/routes/feed.routes.js" as Routes
participant "src/middleware/requireAuth.js" as Auth
participant "src/services/feedService.js" as Service
participant "src/domain/feedRules.js" as Rules
participant "src/db/database.js" as Data
database PostgreSQL as DB

Viewer -> Comments : Open comments
Comments -> Client : Request first comment page
Client -> Routes : GET /api/feed/posts/:postId/comments
Routes -> Service : Read public comments
Service -> Data : Published post; 20 oldest-first comments
Data -> DB : Publication check and keyset query (fetch 21)
DB --> Data : Rows and page boundary
Data --> Service : Public comment authors/text
Service --> Routes : Comments and nextCursor
Routes --> Client : 200 { comments, nextCursor }
Client --> Comments : Render comments; offer Load more if needed

Viewer -> Comments : Submit comment
alt Visitor
  Comments --> Viewer : Offer sign-in; preserve input if present
else Signed-in user
  Comments -> Client : Submit text; disable submit while pending
  Client -> Routes : POST /api/feed/posts/:postId/comments { text }
  Routes -> Auth : Verify active bearer session
  Auth --> Routes : Verified account or 401
  Routes -> Service : Create comment using verified author
  Service -> Rules : Trim and validate plain text (1-1000 characters)
  Rules --> Service : Valid text or 400
  Service -> Data : Save comment on published post
  Data -> DB : Check publication; INSERT comment; read count
  DB --> Data : Saved comment and count
  Data --> Service : Result
  Service --> Routes : Public saved comment and commentCount
  Routes --> Client : 201 result / error response
  Client --> Comments : Saved result / failure
  Comments --> Viewer : Show saved comment; clear submitted input; update count
end
@enduml
